Animas — Python kernel for Magitech
==================================

Animas is a Python implementation of the paradigm formalized in
"A Programming Paradigm for Spatiotemporal Composability" (arXiv:2608.25512,
https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.25512). The paper is Animas's design invariant; no
upstream framework is a forward target.

The historical conformance milestone was completed against canonical Cordis
v4.0.0-rc.13 (commit bc9fae7). The earlier conformance reference was DeepSeek
Harness (https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) at pin fcc0ad46
(dsh v0.2.2-rc.1), retained as historical provenance and a secondary
conformance source. Animas's schema and utility surfaces also derive from the
MIT-licensed schemastery and cosmokit libraries.

